  "description": "A production-ready, lightweight Nacos configuration SDK for .NET. HTTP-only design with zero gRPC dependencies, built on modern async/await patterns and IHttpClientFactory for optimal connection pooling. Features dual authentication (username/password and AK/SK), automatic failover, local snapshot caching, and real-time config change notifications. Perfect for microservices and cloud-native applications.",
